This product includes material derived from the Android Open Source Project
and the LineageOS android_frameworks_base tree, licensed under Apache 2.0:

- SystemUI status_bar.xml and status-bar dimensions (design reference).
- SettingsLib Wi-Fi and mobile signal VectorDrawables (geometry and opacity).
- SystemUI airplane, alarm, VPN, location, Bluetooth, lock, rotation-lock and
  screen-recording, and framework DND
  VectorDrawables (geometry).
- SystemUI BatteryFrame.kt, BatteryGlyph.kt, BatteryColors.kt and
  UnifiedBattery.kt (battery geometry, digit/attribution paths, colours and layout).
- SettingsLib SignalDrawable.java, ThemedBatteryDrawable.kt and framework
  cellular drawables (design references).
- SystemUI ScreenRecordChipViewModel, ColorsModel.Red, ongoing activity chip
  layout/dimensions/colours and drawing code (recording chip design and references).
- Framework InsetsController/InsetsPolicy and SystemUI bar transitions
  (transient status-bar animation timing and easing references).
- SystemUI privacy chip/dot drawables, dimensions, SystemEventCoordinator,
  SystemEventChipAnimationController, SystemStatusAnimationScheduler and
  StatusBarSystemEventAnimator (privacy appearance, choreography and timing).
- SystemUI AutoHideControllerImpl, PhoneStatusBarViewController and
  CentralSurfacesImpl (transient outside-touch dismissal and timeout references).

